WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:08.008
Here at St. Vladimir's,

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.343
we all know the 
dangers that lurk

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.846
outside our gates.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:16.099
I want to do my sworn duty.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:19.561
I want to protect my best friend

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.021
from danger.

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:29.279
And I want a life 
to call my own.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.698
I would never bet against you,

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.116
Rose Hathaway.

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:36.369
You must prepare Lissa 
for her new role

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.079
as head of the Dragomir family.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:38.872
And Rose?

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.040
She'll do her duty.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.334
I'm the royal princess
that needs protecting.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:46.379
Rose gives and gives 
and I take and take.

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:49.758
But I can be a leader who ruled 
not just for the royals,

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.134
but for all citizens.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:53.636
Whether you wear 
the crown or not,

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:55.180
you have the power

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.848
to change things.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:01.770
There's something 
strange happening.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.189
I think I can help you.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.733
Christian is a nonstarter
for a lot of people.

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:08.860
I'll be discreet.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.153
Of course I want
to put you first.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:11.654
But I can't.

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:13.740
You can either be 
guardian or friend.

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:15.366
Not both.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.535
What's the game plan?

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:18.161
You know me.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.163
More of a roll with 
the punches kind of girl. 

00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:24.667
The ruler is not
just any monarch.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.004
Leadership requires
sacrifice for the greater good.

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.173
I need to fight.

00:01:30.173 --> 00:01:31.257
We need to fight.

00:01:35.386 --> 00:01:36.679
They must be willing to give

00:01:36.679 --> 00:01:38.098
everything they have.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.183
We deserve a better future.

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:44.062
They're here.

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.235
She's my family.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:51.611
I would die for her.

